  "scripts" : [
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 21,
      "npc" : "MVP Warper",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[ ^0065DFMVP Warper^000000 ]\nWould you like to enter\nthe MVP Arena?",
      "translation" : "[ ^0065DFMVP傳送員^000000 ]\n您想進入MVP競技場嗎？"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 24,
      "npc" : "MVP Warper",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Yes!",
      "translation" : "我要進去！"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 24,
      "npc" : "MVP Warper",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "No thanks.",
      "translation" : "不用了，謝謝"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 31,
      "npc" : "MVP Arena Guide",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[ ^0065DFMVP Arena Guide^000000 ]\nWelcome and behold this sacred place. Here you will find out if you truly have what it takes to call yourself a warrior.",
      "translation" : "[ ^0065DFMVP競技場嚮導^000000 ]\n歡迎來到這片神聖之地。在這裡，您將證明自己是否真正具備成為戰士的資格。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 34,
      "npc" : "MVP Arena Guide",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Information",
      "translation" : "瞭解規則"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 34,
      "npc" : "MVP Arena Guide",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Heal me!",
      "translation" : "幫我恢復"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 34,
      "npc" : "MVP Arena Guide",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Return to Prontera",
      "translation" : "返回普隆德拉"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 34,
      "npc" : "MVP Arena Guide",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Cancel",
      "translation" : "取消"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 36,
      "npc" : "MVP Arena Guide",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[ ^0065DFMVP Arena Guide^000000 ]\nThere are four Keepers, and each can spawn four different MVPs.\nThere are eight rooms per Keeper, and sixteen MVPs in total.",
      "translation" : "[ ^0065DFMVP競技場嚮導^000000 ]\n這裡有四位守護者，每位守護者可以召喚四種不同的MVP。\n每位守護者有八個房間，總共有十六個MVP。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 55,
      "npc" : "Keeper",
      "placeholders" : [
        "strnpcinfo(1)"
      ],
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[ ^0065DF{0}^000000 ]\nWhich arena would you\nlike to enter?",
      "translation" : "[ ^0065DF{0}^000000 ]\n您想進入哪個競技場？"
